<description>&lt;p&gt;France is negotiating a new defence agreement with Iraq that would extend to the Kurdistan Region, while Iran is accused of deliberately undermining Iraq's security. Iraqi intelligence helped the UAE seize 200,000 Captagon pills in a joint operation and the Iraqi government has suspended operations at the Al-Shib border crossing with Iran. ISIS claimed responsibility for an explosion that killed an Iraqi Brigadier General and his aide, and the KRG denied reports of Ukrainian drones and personnel in the region. The Iraqi foreign minister met the International Crisis Group president to discuss security developments, and 396 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTE5TeUJCdC1ZamlzZ1laM0xIRXZDRHlpWEdoSGdSNlNCcmRMMzN0RmM0QUphVnAzT1hJU2ZnNk1jSEw5eE9DdUI5ZkFWak4tZlNGai1UUHlqNWIzcFpMNTR3U1BfYlQ1WUlzS2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Rudaw&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxPMFA3QVB1UzdMNkN0SnBuQmdHTENRaTAxZ0FRSV9NNzJGNjJIMlBkM2xRRHhDUV81WHNxX0hiMk9YMElOaWNrTmhkNnNuN2VJbDBXdXdZcTJxSmg4M1o5cVBCVUNRUmhBMGNaY0Y3TlJCVEZBbWRoNUZLbFlVY0Ywem01bEZOWngydnBIQ1VLTGNBazR6Y01oNHJtNkNzbU5zSXRvUDdGWkpsdl9fZTRCMVQ2SDVoa3dzc0FHXw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The National&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiREFVX3lxTE9fZ1dqd090NzVETUJRa284OVNsdmpYbEM0NnJrLU5NNTRNMkdHV0ZzMGNjY3ZHZzE0TmlrSGswS1Y4UnpY?oc=5&quot;&gt;964media&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiS0FVX3lxTE9zNjlMX1NxS09hdU40eDg0MTRKMUNEMnV0RFF4U3luSjc3bjI5TmZyODJuVFl0bEdUbEVrS0xudENHcGNaYjh0dTdOWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Region&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxQUFAyM05OR2FFSkEwRUhOdlNnSGxIMjBENkdMdnU3NVQzc1VRODVaU3BkU1ZUd0c0TTYxaEdXUjdhQlJqejN1MGhkcHdqeWx2V2hBeE1